                        <h2 class="font-weight-bold">The cost of well-functioning safely managed urban sanitation</h2>
                        <p class="mt-0 mt-sm-4 mb-0">The CACTUS project creates globally-relevant cost comparators for
                            urban sanitation.  CACTUS uses a large database of empirical cost data from both on- and
                            off-site sanitation systems around the world to create conceptual cost models for
                            complete fully functioning systems.  CACTUS uses a standard cost metric – total annualised
                            cost per household (TACH) to report high level cost estimates.   </p>
